        "text": "m = 25t + 3",
        "rationale": "This swaps the rate and the starting value."
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "text": "m = 9t + 25",
        "rationale": "Divide the change 9 by the 3 months it took."
      },
      {
        "id": "E",
        "text": "m = 3t + 25",
        "rationale": "Correct."
      }
    ],
    "correct_choice": "E",
    "explanation": "Rate = (46 − 37)/(7 − 4) = 3 per month. Then 37 = 3·4 + b gives b = 25, so m = 3t + 25.",
